==Old Dutch==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gem-pro|odt}} {{m|gem-pro|*bindaną}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|odt}} {{m|ine-pro|*bʰendʰ-||bind}}. Cognate with Old Saxon {{term|bindan|lang=osx}}, Old English {{term|bindan|lang=ang}}, Old High German {{term|bintan|lang=goh}}, Old Norse {{term|binda|lang=non}}.

===Verb===
{{head|odt|verb}}

# to [[bind]], to [[join]]

